{"id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","title":"Smooth Manifold","display":"df-smooth-manifold — Smooth Manifold","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-smooth-manifold","aliases":["58-df-smooth-manifold","Smooth Manifold","Differentiable Manifold"],"display":"df-smooth-manifold — Smooth Manifold","depends_on":["[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[58-df-atlas]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-smooth-manifold"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-smooth-manifold</span><span>Smooth Manifold</span><span>Differentiable Manifold</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smooth-manifold — Smooth Manifold"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d530952583f9f96d\" href=\"?note=d530952583f9f96d\" title=\"58-df-atlas\">58-df-atlas</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span> (dimension)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\">\\(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\)</span> (carrier, topology, and atlas candidates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothCompatible}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal A,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothCompatible}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal A,n)\\)</span> 保留原名，其含义由下列公式给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|x\\|_2=(\\sum_{i&lt;n}|x(i)|^2)^{1/2}\">\\(\\|x\\|_2=(\\sum_{i&lt;n}|x(i)|^2)^{1/2}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_j=\\{\\langle i,\\mathbf1_{\\{j\\}}(i)\\rangle:i&lt;n\\}\">\\(e_j=\\{\\langle i,\\mathbf1_{\\{j\\}}(i)\\rangle:i&lt;n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}n^k\">\\(n^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}n^k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w^\\frown\\langle j\\rangle\">\\(w^\\frown\\langle j\\rangle\\)</span> 为有限序列连接。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuousRealOn}_S(f,U,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuousRealOn}_S(f,U,n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoordinateDerivative}_S(g,f,U,n,j)\">\\(\\mathrm{CoordinateDerivative}_S(g,f,U,n,j)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}_S(h,U,n,m)\">\\(\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}_S(h,U,n,m)\\)</span> 为下式定义的辅助谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Atlas}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Atlas}_S\\)</span> (atlas predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d530952583f9f96d\" href=\"?note=d530952583f9f96d\" title=\"58-df-atlas\">58-df-atlas</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\n\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(\\|y-x\\|_2&lt;r\\to y\\in U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\n\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(\\|y-x\\|_2&lt;r\\to y\\in U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ContinuousRealOn}_S(f,U,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land f\\in\\mathbb R^U\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in U\\;\n(\\|y-x\\|_2&lt;\\delta\\to |f(y)-f(x)|&lt;\\varepsilon).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ContinuousRealOn}_S(f,U,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land f\\in\\mathbb R^U\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in U\\;\n(\\|y-x\\|_2&lt;\\delta\\to |f(y)-f(x)|&lt;\\varepsilon).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CoordinateDerivative}_S(g,f,U,n,j)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\land j\\in n\\land f,g\\in\\mathbb R^U\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\n0&lt;|t|&lt;\\delta\\land x+te_j\\in U\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\to\\left|\\frac{f(x+te_j)-f(x)}t-g(x)\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CoordinateDerivative}_S(g,f,U,n,j)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\land j\\in n\\land f,g\\in\\mathbb R^U\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\n0&lt;|t|&lt;\\delta\\land x+te_j\\in U\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\to\\left|\\frac{f(x+te_j)-f(x)}t-g(x)\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}_S(h,U,n,m)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n,m\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\land h\\in(\\mathbb R^m)^U\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in m\\;\\exists D\\in(\\mathbb R^U)^{n^{&lt;\\omega}}\\;\\Bigl(\nD(\\emptyset)=\\{\\langle x,h(x)(i)\\rangle:x\\in U\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall w\\in n^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\mathrm{ContinuousRealOn}_S(D(w),U,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall w\\in n^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall j\\in n\\;\n\\mathrm{CoordinateDerivative}_S(D(w^\\frown\\langle j\\rangle),D(w),U,n,j)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}_S(h,U,n,m)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n,m\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\land h\\in(\\mathbb R^m)^U\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in m\\;\\exists D\\in(\\mathbb R^U)^{n^{&lt;\\omega}}\\;\\Bigl(\nD(\\emptyset)=\\{\\langle x,h(x)(i)\\rangle:x\\in U\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall w\\in n^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\mathrm{ContinuousRealOn}_S(D(w),U,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall w\\in n^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall j\\in n\\;\n\\mathrm{CoordinateDerivative}_S(D(w^\\frown\\langle j\\rangle),D(w),U,n,j)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SmoothCompatible}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal A,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\exists U,W,\\phi\\in V\\;(c=\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\land W\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\phi,U,W))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\forall\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\n\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}_S(\\{\\langle\\phi(x),\\psi(x)\\rangle:x\\in U\\cap V\\},\\phi[U\\cap V],n,n).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SmoothCompatible}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal A,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\exists U,W,\\phi\\in V\\;(c=\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\land W\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\phi,U,W))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\forall\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\n\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}_S(\\{\\langle\\phi(x),\\psi(x)\\rangle:x\\in U\\cap V\\},\\phi[U\\cap V],n,n).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}manifold\\text{-}structure}\\vdash{}&amp;\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(M,\\tau)\\land\\operatorname{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\tau,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;(x\\neq y\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\emptyset))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\left(|\\mathcal B|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(x\\in B\\subseteq U)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{SmoothCompatible}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal A,n).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}manifold\\text{-}structure}\\vdash{}&amp;\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(M,\\tau)\\land\\operatorname{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\tau,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;(x\\neq y\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\emptyset))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\left(|\\mathcal B|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(x\\in B\\subseteq U)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{SmoothCompatible}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal A,n).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}manifold}\\vdash\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}manifold}\\vdash\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Smooth manifold: a Hausdorff, second-countable topological manifold equipped with an atlas whose transition maps are smooth.</li>\n<li>旧名中的下标 <code>meta</code> 仅作为兼容名称保留；其全阶偏导数、连续性和过渡映射均已在 Assertion 中定义。</li>\n<li>Differentiability: defined via charts</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty\">\\(C^\\infty\\)</span>-structure: maximal atlas is smooth structure</li>\n<li>Examples: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span>, spheres, tori, Lie groups</li>\n<li>Chart compatibility and tangent-space consequences are downstream atoms.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lee, Introduction to Smooth Manifolds</li>\n<li>Warner, Foundations of Differentiable Manifolds</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-atlas","status":"resolved","id":"d530952583f9f96d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-atlas]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate, see [[58-df-topological-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-atlas","status":"resolved","id":"d530952583f9f96d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Atlas}_S$ (atlas predicate, see [[58-df-atlas]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Bijective}$ 取 [[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"M,\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothCompatible}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal A,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\|x\\|_2=(\\sum_{i<n}|x(i)|^2)^{1/2}","display":false},{"tex":"e_j=\\{\\langle i,\\mathbf1_{\\{j\\}}(i)\\rangle:i<n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n^{<\\omega}=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}n^k","display":false},{"tex":"w^\\frown\\langle j\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContinuousRealOn}_S(f,U,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CoordinateDerivative}_S(g,f,U,n,j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}_S(h,U,n,m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Atlas}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega_{>0}\\land U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\n\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(\\|y-x\\|_2<r\\to y\\in U).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ContinuousRealOn}_S(f,U,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&n\\in\\omega_{>0}\\land U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land f\\in\\mathbb R^U\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall y\\in U\\;\n(\\|y-x\\|_2<\\delta\\to |f(y)-f(x)|<\\varepsilon).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CoordinateDerivative}_S(g,f,U,n,j)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\land j\\in n\\land f,g\\in\\mathbb R^U\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\n0<|t|<\\delta\\land x+te_j\\in U\\\\\n&\\hspace{35mm}\\to\\left|\\frac{f(x+te_j)-f(x)}t-g(x)\\right|<\\varepsilon\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}_S(h,U,n,m)\\leftrightarrow{}&n,m\\in\\omega_{>0}\\land\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\land h\\in(\\mathbb R^m)^U\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i\\in m\\;\\exists D\\in(\\mathbb R^U)^{n^{<\\omega}}\\;\\Bigl(\nD(\\emptyset)=\\{\\langle x,h(x)(i)\\rangle:x\\in U\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall w\\in n^{<\\omega}\\;\\mathrm{ContinuousRealOn}_S(D(w),U,n)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall w\\in n^{<\\omega}\\;\\forall j\\in n\\;\n\\mathrm{CoordinateDerivative}_S(D(w^\\frown\\langle j\\rangle),D(w),U,n,j)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SmoothCompatible}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal A,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&n\\in\\omega_{>0}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\exists U,W,\\phi\\in V\\;(c=\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\land W\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\phi,U,W))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\forall\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\n\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}_S(\\{\\langle\\phi(x),\\psi(x)\\rangle:x\\in U\\cap V\\},\\phi[U\\cap V],n,n).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}manifold\\text{-}structure}\\vdash{}&\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&n\\in\\omega_{>0}\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(M,\\tau)\\land\\operatorname{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\tau,n)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;(x\\neq y\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\emptyset))\\\\\n&\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\left(|\\mathcal B|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(x\\in B\\subseteq U)\\right)\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{SmoothCompatible}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal A,n).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}manifold}\\vdash\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n).","display":true},{"tex":"C^\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}^n","display":false}],"bytes":4807,"backlinks":[{"id":"c800033782eba35e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1cb1491fbbaff37d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,m)$ 与 $\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(N,n)$（see [[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]）"},{"id":"1b06c1162d3facfd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,3)$（光滑 3-流形，see [[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]）"},{"id":"bc8c800bbf59f617","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\omega_{>0}$ 且 $\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)$（see [[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]）"},{"id":"efe8e2f202483a88","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{CoordinateDerivative}$、$\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}$ 取 [[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"07d803337c0e6ed3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]])"},{"id":"d7bfcf5788937844","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"432be048cd519891","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f91503f4398fd2f3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"db62358c2ba471b0","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d9555f490728227b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}$ (smooth-manifold predicate, see [[58-df-smooth-manifold]])"},{"id":"b6060c5d1003e78e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"56f078003b4a5a13","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"413736d776e8d283","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e6b661f277e95d9f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6909e67a0a112410","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"e